# MD output: ~15 GB of trajectories and topologies, mirrored from
# /tamir2/kovaliov/md50_150mM on the cluster. Only the tables below are tracked.
# The tables rebuild from these; see ../README.md.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# The per-dinucleotide tables and the screen that chose the observables are the result the
# rest of the code reads, and cannot be rebuilt without the cluster. Small enough to track.
!features/
features/*
!features/tables/
!features/tables/*.csv
!features/screen.csv
!features/correlations.csv
